msgid "Sonar L04xMTW / GL04xMT"
msgstr "声呐 L04xMTW / GL04xMT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:7
#: d333db8504084248b5e673d74d48a891
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The L04xMTW / GL04xMT is an echosounders (aka underwater sonar) with a 2 / 6"
" m range. More details can be found in the `datasheet "
"<https://github.com/AlksSAV/Sonar-"
"to-i2c-NMEA-/blob/main/L04xMTW%20%20GL04xMT%20datasheet.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"L04xMTW / GL04xMT 是测深仪（即水下声呐），测量范围为2/6米。更多详情请参阅 `数据手册 "
"<https://github.com/AlksSAV/Sonar-"
"to-i2c-NMEA-/blob/main/L04xMTW%20%20GL04xMT%20datasheet.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:10
