msgid "Arduino nano"
msgstr "Arduino nano"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:21
#: 53e5ed103472406a82017cb51dabc8cc
msgid ""
"The firmware file (sonar_to_nmea__SDDBT.ino) is located in this `repository "
"<https://github.com/AlksSAV/Sonar-"
"to-i2c-NMEA-/blob/main/sonar_to_nmea__SDDBT.ino>`__"
msgstr ""
"固件文件（sonar_to_nmea__SDDBT.ino）位于此 `仓库 <https://github.com/AlksSAV/Sonar-"
"to-i2c-NMEA-/blob/main/sonar_to_nmea__SDDBT.ino>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:24
#: f955f23fe1da4ce6acabd2d9a7aeaf3d
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:27
#: b53cee7cb70c403283625adcaa87b0c4
msgid ""
"The L04xMTW / GL04xMT sensors provide distance measurement.  Using Arduino "
"nano sensor data is converted to NMEA 0183 stream. The data is transmitted "
"to the autopilot via the serial port."
msgstr ""
"L04xMTW / GL04xMT 传感器提供距离测量。使用 Arduino nano 将传感器数据转换为 NMEA 0183 "
"数据流，然后通过串口传输到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:29
#: e8d83e156c5445d8a49a5ff6d9892e0b
msgid ""
"The sensor can be connected to any available serial/uart port on the "
"autopilot.  In the diagram below the first sensor is connected to SERIAL2."
msgstr "该传感器可连接到飞控上任意可用的串口/UART 接口。在下方示意图中，第一个传感器连接到 SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:32
#: 04bf1a0a24164400a82394ea4c1cade8
msgid "If the SERIAL2 is used then the following parameters should be set:"
msgstr "如果使用 SERIAL2，则应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:34
#: bde756c15aba4a7fb427012cc3a8e30e
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:35
#: 2c9147d780c645ad95d9ce94aa461087
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:37
#: 6db68a18373e42779356e2a604c84c95
msgid "Then the following range finder related parameters should be set:"
msgstr "然后应设置以下测距仪相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:39
#: b7c29d0acac449d782d890ded63a6bd8
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17（NMEA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:40
#: 86f0ebf1b3d04965a154a6c09796d0ac
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:41
#: 599daf66a1124065aef698985c2e6a2e
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 6 (i.e. 6m).  *This is the distance in "
"meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 6（即6米）。*这是测距仪可可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sonar-L04xMTW-GL04xMT.rst:42
#: af6c7216447f43ccb61e41f80a4da6f7
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (i.e. down) if mounted on a boat"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（即向下），如果安装在船上"
